From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 16 May 2026 08:38:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] F-024: Migrate remaining base SQL files to db-world/base/

Three files in data/sql/world/base/ were missed in the original F-024
folder rename:

- tbc_vendors.sql
- vanilla_pvp_system.sql
- zone_isle_of_queldanas.sql

These never auto-imported, so the IPP vanilla PvP gates (gameobjects
26262 / 626262 / 631660 / 631661 with gobject_ipp_pvp_open|closed
ScriptNames), Sunwell Isle progression edits, and TBC vendor setup
all sat dormant in the database. Move them alongside the other
already-migrated files so zep world sql changed picks them up.
---
 data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/dungeon_coilfang_reservoir.sql  | 0
 data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/dungeon_shadow_labyrinth.sql    | 0
 data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/tbc_vendors.sql                 | 0
 data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/vanilla_creature_immunities.sql | 0
 data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/zone_isle_of_queldanas.sql      | 0
 5 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/dungeon_coilfang_reservoir.sql (100%)
 rename data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/dungeon_shadow_labyrinth.sql (100%)
 rename data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/tbc_vendors.sql (100%)
 rename data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/vanilla_creature_immunities.sql (100%)
 rename data/sql/{world => db-world}/base/zone_isle_of_queldanas.sql (100%)

diff --git a/data/sql/world/base/dungeon_coilfang_reservoir.sql b/data/sql/db-world/base/dungeon_coilfang_reservoir.sql
similarity index 100%
rename from data/sql/world/base/dungeon_coilfang_reservoir.sql
rename to data/sql/db-world/base/dungeon_coilfang_reservoir.sql
diff --git a/data/sql/world/base/dungeon_shadow_labyrinth.sql b/data/sql/db-world/base/dungeon_shadow_labyrinth.sql
similarity index 100%
rename from data/sql/world/base/dungeon_shadow_labyrinth.sql
rename to data/sql/db-world/base/dungeon_shadow_labyrinth.sql
diff --git a/data/sql/world/base/tbc_vendors.sql b/data/sql/db-world/base/tbc_vendors.sql
similarity index 100%
rename from data/sql/world/base/tbc_vendors.sql
rename to data/sql/db-world/base/tbc_vendors.sql
diff --git a/data/sql/world/base/vanilla_creature_immunities.sql b/data/sql/db-world/base/vanilla_creature_immunities.sql
similarity index 100%
rename from data/sql/world/base/vanilla_creature_immunities.sql
rename to data/sql/db-world/base/vanilla_creature_immunities.sql
diff --git a/data/sql/world/base/zone_isle_of_queldanas.sql b/data/sql/db-world/base/zone_isle_of_queldanas.sql
similarity index 100%
rename from data/sql/world/base/zone_isle_of_queldanas.sql
rename to data/sql/db-world/base/zone_isle_of_queldanas.sql
